WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:01,620
I've been hit by a wave of loss in the past few days.

2
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:04,960
Already negative twelve times

3
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:05,880
Not strong enough

4
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:07,040
It's destined to be eliminated

5
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:10,760
The base below is full of prisoners. They said that as long as we rescue them, they will join the rest of the alliance without any second thoughts.

6
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:12,800
I'll take in those who can come, and those who can't.

7
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:13,880
How to live with love

8
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:17,670
I won't save

9
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:19,710
Send them my blessings

10
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:21,150
Three hundred and sixty-five days in a year

11
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:23,070
I give them three hundred and sixty-five blessings

12
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:28,500
Is it enough? Listen carefully.

13
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:29,740
Want to join the rest of the alliance

14
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:30,820
Come here by yourself

15
00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:32,220
No one will save you

16
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:35,430
Princess Han Qingxia will bless you every day

17
00:00:35,430 --> 00:00:38,030
I hope you all come here safely. They are so strong.

18
00:00:38,030 --> 00:00:39,950
Why should we allow ourselves to do the same thing?

19
00:00:39,950 --> 00:00:41,110
Go out and die

20
00:00:41,110 --> 00:00:43,950
It's disgusting to send blessings too
